{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/7dbe5cb81b9605ae84160aea80970a53.avif?t=1759998561\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300e Connected clues lead to a single truth\u300f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected Clue</strong> is an isometric mystery adventure game inspired by the atmosphere of 19th-century detective novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, and use your reasoning to uncover the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A daring bank robbery shakes the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprits escape with a fortune in cash and a priceless treasure from the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As rookie detective <strong>Diana</strong>, you will dive into this case and many other unresolved mysteries.<br>Can you gather the evidence, expose the lies of suspects, and arrest the true culprit?<br>The outcome depends entirely on your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Evidence Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoroughly examine crime scenes and use various tools to secure clues.<br>Study details with a magnifying glass, lift fingerprints with charcoal powder, and connect testimonies through field investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/4308710b01bd55c05e07a2c56a57d2df.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/4308710b01bd55c05e07a2c56a57d2df.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/4308710b01bd55c05e07a2c56a57d2df.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues \u2013 Search crime scenes with detective tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/080033cac49dd565eea42183bde0fbe5.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/080033cac49dd565eea42183bde0fbe5.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/080033cac49dd565eea42183bde0fbe5.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code breaking \u2013 Solve ciphers to reveal hidden locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3107a675a7fba4ac79c425c2ded41bee.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3107a675a7fba4ac79c425c2ded41bee.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/3107a675a7fba4ac79c425c2ded41bee.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/5e3e9a71b9b706a042c3cf01c5977ab5.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/5e3e9a71b9b706a042c3cf01c5977ab5.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/5e3e9a71b9b706a042c3cf01c5977ab5.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogation \u2013 Present evidence to extract testimony </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger is always present at crime scenes.<br>Sneak past suspicious eyes, change disguises to avoid police attention, and subdue criminals who resist arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f1121ef0de148fa6e9b254a001bbea61.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltration \u2013 Change costumes to stay unnoticed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tail &amp; QTE \u2013 Follow suspects from the shadows</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b75c7d54b46dac907b9f8a7e78ffbd17.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat \u2013 Defeat and arrest those who fight back </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected evidence can be organized on the <strong>\u201cDetective\u2019s Wall\u201d</strong> in your office.<br>Identify victims, suspects, weapons, and reconstruct the entire incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all suspects are gathered, expose their lies and point out the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/86f198a219eae4b8ae4bc261febd5fd3.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct the case \u2013 Piece together the full story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/febf41b30c76fce82064e2f9995c2a99.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot contradictions \u2013 Unmask lies and reveal the culprit </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles rely on subtle sound and color cues.<br>To ensure comfortable play for all, we\u2019ve included accessibility options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c638706657834cc42c92ee4245abbbc7.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio support</strong> \u2013 Visual indicators for critical sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color support</strong> \u2013 Adjustable brightness/saturation &amp; color labels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect evidence, interrogate suspects, and uncover the truth.<br>Step into the shoes of a 19th-century detective and challenge unsolved mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your reasoning decides the truth.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1777200?t=1759998561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759998561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/9ef4f90952504fd805bd3d293f281b722ef897f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759998561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/9ef4f90952504fd805bd3d293f281b722ef897f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759998561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/7dbe5cb81b9605ae84160aea80970a53.avif?t=1759998561\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300e Connected clues lead to a single truth\u300f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected Clue</strong> is an isometric mystery adventure game inspired by the atmosphere of 19th-century detective novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, and use your reasoning to uncover the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/f069a423e3ea1e53c451d6bc1d7b6603.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A daring bank robbery shakes the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprits escape with a fortune in cash and a priceless treasure from the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As rookie detective <strong>Diana</strong>, you will dive into this case and many other unresolved mysteries.<br>Can you gather the evidence, expose the lies of suspects, and arrest the true culprit?<br>The outcome depends entirely on your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Evidence Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoroughly examine crime scenes and use various tools to secure clues.<br>Study details with a magnifying glass, lift fingerprints with charcoal powder, and connect testimonies through field investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.webm?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9861f167a56fc7088f77b26f09bdc503.mp4?t=1759998561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/4308710b01bd55c05e07a2c56a57d2df.poster.avif?t=1759998561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/4308710b01bd